# (AI-assisted, j2gaps) Jak II pause menu: into the slums (as jak2_city.pad), then Start opens the
# pause menu over the game's last frame (CtrJak2BlitRenderer: a copy of it at tbp 0x3300, which
# the sky bucket draws tinted behind the menu, as the PC's BlitDisplays), Start again closes it.
# Host: gk --ctr-gfx --ctr-dump <dir> (the shots), C mode or native.
1000 continue ctysluma-start
1001 -
1002 wait *target* target-stance
1003 log pause: ctysluma-start
1300 shot pause_before
1301 start
1307 -
1500 shot pause_menu
1700 shot pause_menu_later
1701 start
1707 -
1900 shot pause_after
1901 pos *target*
2000 exit
